  <body dur="04:10.760">
    <div begin="00:14.450" end="04:10.760">
      <p begin="00:14.450" end="00:17.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:14.450" end="00:14.660">I</span> <span begin="00:14.660" end="00:14.880">can</span> <span begin="00:14.880" end="00:15.120">feel</span> <span begin="00:15.120" end="00:15.210">the</span> <span begin="00:15.320" end="00:15.530">gear</span><span begin="00:15.530" end="00:15.600">s</span> <span begin="00:15.600" end="00:15.720">they're</span> <span begin="00:15.800" end="00:16.000">tur</span><span begin="00:16.000" end="00:16.200">ning</span> <span begin="00:16.200" end="00:16.500">fa</span><span begin="00:16.500" end="00:16.680">s</span><span begin="00:16.680" end="00:17.280">ter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我能感受到齿轮正愈转愈快</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我能感受到齒輪正愈轉愈快</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">歯車がますます速く回り出すのを感じる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">톱니바퀴가 점점 더 빠르게 돌아가는 게 느껴져</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je sens les engrenages tourner de plus en plus vite</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Siento que los engranajes giran cada vez más rápido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich spüre wie die Zahnräder sich immer schneller drehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sinto as engrenagens girando cada vez mais rápido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я чувствую как шестерни вращаются всё быстрее</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sento gli ingranaggi girare sempre più in fretta</span></p>
      <p begin="00:17.930" end="00:20.920" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:17.930" end="00:18.260">Grin</span><span begin="00:18.260" end="00:18.450">ding</span> <span begin="00:18.450" end="00:18.710">down</span> <span begin="00:18.710" end="00:18.890">the</span> <span begin="00:18.890" end="00:19.100">on</span><span begin="00:19.100" end="00:19.370">ly</span> <span begin="00:19.370" end="00:19.530">ho</span><span begin="00:19.610" end="00:19.690">pe</span> <span begin="00:19.690" end="00:20.010">we</span> <span begin="00:20.010" end="00:20.760">ha</span><span begin="00:20.760" end="00:20.920">ve</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将我们仅存的希望一点点碾碎</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">將我們僅存的希望一點點碾碎</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">俺たちに残された唯一の希望さえ 磨り潰しながら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리가 가진 유일한 희망을 갈아 버리며</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Broyant le seul espoir qu'il nous reste</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Desgastando la única esperanza que nos queda</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und die einzige Hoffnung zermalmen die uns noch bleibt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esmagando a única esperança que nos resta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Перемалывая нашу последнюю надежду</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Stritolando l'unica speranza che ci resta</span></p>
      <p begin="00:21.540" end="00:25.390" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:21.540" end="00:21.780">No</span> <span begin="00:21.780" end="00:21.980">one</span> <span begin="00:21.980" end="00:22.240">could</span> <span begin="00:22.240" end="00:22.420">have</span> <span begin="00:22.420" end="00:22.570">p</span><span begin="00:22.570" end="00:22.780">lanned</span> <span begin="00:22.870" end="00:23.350">for</span> <span begin="00:23.350" end="00:23.570">thi</span><span begin="00:23.570" end="00:23.760">s</span> <span begin="00:23.760" end="00:24.070">di</span><span begin="00:24.070" end="00:24.240">s</span><span begin="00:24.240" end="00:24.520">a</span><span begin="00:24.520" end="00:24.680">s</span><span begin="00:24.680" end="00:25.390">ter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谁也未曾料到这场浩劫</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">誰也未曾料到這場浩劫</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">こんな惨劇を誰が予想できただろう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">누구도 이런 재앙에 대비할 수 없었어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Personne n'aurait pu prévoir ce désastre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nadie podría haber previsto este desastre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Niemand hätte diese Katastrophe vorhersehen können</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ninguém poderia ter previsto este desastre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Никто не мог предвидеть эту катастрофу</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Nessuno avrebbe potuto prevedere questa catastrofe</span></p>
      <p begin="00:28.200" end="00:30.360" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:28.200" end="00:28.490">But</span> <span begin="00:28.490" end="00:28.700">i</span><span begin="00:28.810" end="00:28.950">f</span> <span begin="00:28.950" end="00:29.340">we</span> <span begin="00:29.340" end="00:30.210">ri</span><span begin="00:30.210" end="00:30.360">se</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但只要我们挺身而起</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">但只要我們挺身而起</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">それでも俺たちが立ち上がり</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하지만 우리가 일어선다면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mais si nous nous relevons</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pero si nos alzamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Doch wenn wir uns erheben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mas se nos erguermos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Но если мы восстанем</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ma se ci rialziamo</span></p>
      <p begin="00:30.600" end="00:34.020" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:30.600" end="00:30.760">And</span> <span begin="00:30.840" end="00:31.140">ju</span><span begin="00:31.140" end="00:31.300">s</span><span begin="00:31.300" end="00:31.390">t</span> <span begin="00:31.390" end="00:31.590">o</span><span begin="00:31.760" end="00:32.020">pe</span><span begin="00:32.020" end="00:32.260">n u</span><span begin="00:32.410" end="00:32.870">p ou</span><span begin="00:32.870" end="00:33.840">r eye</span><span begin="00:33.840" end="00:34.020">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">睁开双眼 看清眼前的一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">睜開雙眼 看清眼前的一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">その目を見開きさえすれば</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그리고 두 눈을 활짝 뜬다면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et ouvrons simplement les yeux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y simplemente abrimos los ojos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und einfach unsere Augen öffnen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E simplesmente abrirmos os olhos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И просто откроем глаза</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E apriamo finalmente gli occhi</span></p>
      <p begin="00:35.280" end="00:39.390" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:35.280" end="00:35.370">The</span> <span begin="00:35.550" end="00:35.990">pain</span> <span begin="00:35.990" end="00:36.240">won't</span> <span begin="00:36.240" end="00:36.430">s</span><span begin="00:36.430" end="00:36.710">to</span><span begin="00:36.870" end="00:37.170">p u</span><span begin="00:37.170" end="00:37.330">s</span> <span begin="00:37.330" end="00:37.460">from</span> <span begin="00:37.560" end="00:37.850">get</span><span begin="00:37.850" end="00:38.250">ting</span> <span begin="00:38.250" end="00:39.180">ou</span><span begin="00:39.180" end="00:39.390">t</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">苦痛便无法阻止我们冲出重围</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">苦痛便無法阻止我們衝出重圍</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">どんな痛みも 俺たちの脱出を阻めはしない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">고통도 우리가 벗어나는 걸 막지 못해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La douleur ne nous empêchera pas de nous en sortir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El dolor no nos impedirá salir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wird der Schmerz uns nicht daran hindern hier herauszukommen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A dor não vai nos impedir de escapar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Боль не помешает нам выбраться</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il dolore non ci impedirà di venirne fuori</span></p>
      <p begin="00:41.320" end="00:42.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:41.320" end="00:41.470">Don't</span> <span begin="00:41.570" end="00:41.790">thin</span><span begin="00:41.790" end="00:41.880">k a</span><span begin="00:42.000" end="00:42.460">bout</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别再想着</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">別再想著</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">考えるな</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">생각하지 마</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ne te contente pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No te conformes con</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Denk nicht daran</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não se contente em</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже не думай</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non pensare a</span></p>
      <p begin="00:42.840" end="00:43.720" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:42.840" end="00:43.130">Hol</span><span begin="00:43.130" end="00:43.360">ding</span> <span begin="00:43.360" end="00:43.720">out</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一味苦撑下去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">一味苦撐下去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ただ耐え忍ぶことなど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그저 버티기만 하는 건</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">De tenir bon</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Seguir resistiendo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Noch länger auszuharren</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Apenas resistir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">О том чтобы просто выжидать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Resistere e basta</span></p>
      <p begin="00:44.020" end="00:45.550" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:44.020" end="00:44.110">The</span> <span begin="00:44.230" end="00:44.460">time</span> <span begin="00:44.460" end="00:44.570">i</span><span begin="00:44.570" end="00:44.690">s</span> <span begin="00:44.690" end="00:44.910">now</span> <span begin="00:44.910" end="00:45.120">or</span> <span begin="00:45.120" end="00:45.350">ne</span><span begin="00:45.350" end="00:45.550">ver</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要么就在此刻 要么永远错过</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">要麼就在此刻 要麼永遠錯過</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">やるなら今だ 今を逃せば二度とない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지금이 아니면 기회는 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C'est maintenant ou jamais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Es ahora o nunca</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jetzt oder nie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">É agora ou nunca</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сейчас или никогда</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il momento è ora o mai più</span></p>
      <p begin="00:45.770" end="00:47.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:45.770" end="00:46.000">We</span> <span begin="00:46.000" end="00:46.220">hol</span><span begin="00:46.220" end="00:46.430">d it</span> <span begin="00:46.430" end="00:46.660">all</span> <span begin="00:46.660" end="00:46.760">to</span><span begin="00:46.880" end="00:47.140">ge</span><span begin="00:47.140" end="00:47.340">ther</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们携手守住这一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們攜手守住這一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">俺たちの手で すべてを支え抜くんだ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우린 함께 모든 걸 지켜 낼 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ensemble nous maintenons tout debout</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Lo mantenemos todo unido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Gemeinsam halten wir alles zusammen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Juntos mantemos tudo de pé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вместе мы удержим всё</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Insieme teniamo tutto in piedi</span></p>
      <p begin="00:47.530" end="00:49.270" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:47.530" end="00:47.800">We</span> <span begin="00:47.800" end="00:48.010">have</span> <span begin="00:48.010" end="00:48.120">the</span> <span begin="00:48.200" end="00:48.440">po</span><span begin="00:48.440" end="00:48.640">wer</span> <span begin="00:48.640" end="00:48.870">to</span> <span begin="00:48.870" end="00:49.200">ri</span><span begin="00:49.200" end="00:49.270">se</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们拥有奋起反抗的力量</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們擁有奮起反抗的力量</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">俺たちには立ち上がる力がある</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리에게는 일어설 힘이 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous avons la force de nous relever</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tenemos la fuerza para alzarnos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir haben die Kraft uns zu erheben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Temos a força para nos erguer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">У нас есть силы восстать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Abbiamo la forza di rialzarci</span></p>
      <p begin="00:49.330" end="00:51.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:49.330" end="00:49.550">Count</span> <span begin="00:49.550" end="00:49.800">down</span> <span begin="00:49.800" end="00:50.020">the</span> <span begin="00:50.020" end="00:50.250">ho</span><span begin="00:50.250" end="00:50.370">ur</span><span begin="00:50.370" end="00:50.470">s</span> <span begin="00:50.470" end="00:50.670">'ti</span><span begin="00:50.670" end="00:51.160">l I</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">倒数着分秒 直到我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">倒數著分秒 直到我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">その時が来るまで 残された時間を数える</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가 나설 때까지 남은 시간을 세어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je compte les heures jusqu'à ce que je</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cuenta las horas hasta que yo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Zähl die Stunden bis ich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Conte as horas até eu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Отсчитывай часы до того как я</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Conto le ore fino al momento in cui</span></p>
      <p begin="00:51.690" end="00:56.510" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:51.690" end="00:51.790">C</span><span begin="00:51.790" end="00:52.060">ra</span><span begin="00:52.060" end="00:52.260">sh</span> <span begin="00:52.260" end="00:52.450">it</span> <span begin="00:52.640" end="00:52.970">down</span> <span begin="00:53.080" end="00:53.240">ju</span><span begin="00:53.240" end="00:53.340">st</span> <span begin="00:53.340" end="00:53.430">to</span> <span begin="00:53.540" end="00:53.820">bring</span> <span begin="00:53.820" end="00:54.030">it</span> <span begin="00:54.210" end="00:54.660">back</span> <span begin="00:54.830" end="00:55.120">to</span> <span begin="00:55.120" end="00:56.320">li</span><span begin="00:56.320" end="00:56.510">fe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲手将它击碎 只为令其重获新生</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">親手將它擊碎 只為令其重獲新生</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">すべてを叩き壊し 再び命を吹き込むために</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">다시 되살리기 위해 모조리 무너뜨릴 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Fasse tout s'effondrer pour lui redonner vie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Lo derribe solo para devolverle la vida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Alles niederreiße nur um es wieder zum Leben zu erwecken</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Derrubar tudo só para trazê-lo de volta à vida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Разрушу всё лишь затем чтобы вернуть к жизни</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Abbatterò tutto solo per riportarlo in vita</span></p>
      <p begin="00:57.080" end="01:00.610" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:57.080" end="00:57.490">Fa</span><span begin="00:57.490" end="00:57.600">ce</span> <span begin="00:57.750" end="00:57.860">to</span> <span begin="00:57.970" end="00:58.400">fa</span><span begin="00:58.400" end="00:58.520">ce</span> <span begin="00:58.640" end="00:58.770">wi</span><span begin="00:58.770" end="00:58.870">th</span> <span begin="00:58.870" end="00:59.220">the</span> <span begin="00:59.320" end="00:59.640">ma</span><span begin="00:59.760" end="01:00.610">chine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与那庞然巨械正面相对</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">與那龐然巨械正面相對</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">鋼鉄の機械と真正面から対峙する</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">기계와 정면으로 맞서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Face à face avec la machine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Frente a frente con la máquina</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Der Maschine Auge in Auge gegenüberstehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Cara a cara com a máquina</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Лицом к лицу с машиной</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Faccia a faccia con la macchina</span></p>
      <p begin="01:01.510" end="01:04.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:01.510" end="01:01.700">Thi</span><span begin="01:01.700" end="01:01.780">s</span> <span begin="01:01.780" end="01:01.890">i</span><span begin="01:01.890" end="01:02.010">s</span> <span begin="01:02.010" end="01:02.180">where</span> <span begin="01:02.180" end="01:02.340">I'm</span> <span begin="01:02.440" end="01:02.750">born</span> <span begin="01:02.860" end="01:03.130">to</span> <span begin="01:03.320" end="01:04.080">be</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这里便是我生来注定的战场</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這裡便是我生來注定的戰場</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この場所に立つために 俺は生まれた</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">난 바로 이 자리에 서기 위해 태어났어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je suis né pour être ici</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nací para estar aquí</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Hierfür bin ich geboren</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu nasci para estar aqui</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Именно здесь мне суждено быть</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sono nato per essere qui</span></p>
