      <p begin="01:36.180" end="01:38.760" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:36.180" end="01:36.380">Rea</span><span begin="01:36.380" end="01:36.540">ching</span> <span begin="01:36.640" end="01:36.850">for</span> <span begin="01:36.850" end="01:37.050">the</span> <span begin="01:37.050" end="01:37.260">hand</span> <span begin="01:37.340" end="01:37.510">that</span> <span begin="01:37.510" end="01:37.760">hol</span><span begin="01:37.760" end="01:37.830">ds</span> <span begin="01:37.830" end="01:37.990">u</span><span begin="01:37.990" end="01:38.200">s</span> <span begin="01:38.200" end="01:38.760">down</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伸手抓向那只将我们死死压制的手</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">伸手抓向那隻將我們死死壓制的手</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">俺たちを押さえつけるその手へと 手を伸ばす</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리를 짓누르는 손을 향해 손을 뻗으며</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je tends la main vers celle qui nous maintient à terre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Intentando alcanzar la mano que nos mantiene sometidos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich greife nach der Hand die uns niederhält</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tentando alcançar a mão que nos mantém presos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Тянусь к руке, что прижимает нас к земле</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Cercando di afferrare la mano che ci tiene schiacciati</span></p>
      <p begin="01:39.740" end="01:42.140" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:39.740" end="01:40.000">Fear</span> <span begin="01:40.000" end="01:40.130">can</span> <span begin="01:40.220" end="01:40.470">turn</span> <span begin="01:40.470" end="01:40.730">you</span> <span begin="01:40.730" end="01:40.890">in</span><span begin="01:40.890" end="01:41.090">to</span> <span begin="01:41.090" end="01:41.220">a</span> <span begin="01:41.340" end="01:41.640">mon</span><span begin="01:41.640" end="01:41.800">s</span><span begin="01:41.800" end="01:42.140">ter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恐惧能将你变成怪物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">恐懼能將你變成怪物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">恐怖は人を怪物へと変えてしまう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">두려움은 널 괴물로 만들 수도 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La peur peut faire de toi un monstre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El miedo puede convertirte en un monstruo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Angst kann dich in ein Monster verwandeln</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O medo pode transformar você num monstro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Страх может превратить тебя в чудовище</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La paura può trasformarti in un mostro</span></p>
      <p begin="01:42.440" end="01:44.040" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:42.440" end="01:42.650">In</span><span begin="01:42.650" end="01:42.900">to</span> <span begin="01:42.900" end="01:43.010">a</span> <span begin="01:43.130" end="01:43.560">mar</span><span begin="01:43.560" end="01:44.040">tyr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也能让你沦为殉道者</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">也能讓你淪為殉道者</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">あるいは殉教者へと</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">순교자로 만들 수도 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un martyr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">En un mártir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">In einen Märtyrer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Num mártir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В мученика</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In un martire</span></p>
      <p begin="01:45.290" end="01:48.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:45.290" end="01:45.420">But</span> <span begin="01:45.510" end="01:45.640">ju</span><span begin="01:45.640" end="01:45.790">st</span> <span begin="01:45.790" end="01:45.970">re</span><span begin="01:45.970" end="01:46.210">mem</span><span begin="01:46.210" end="01:46.440">ber</span> <span begin="01:46.440" end="01:46.690">that</span> <span begin="01:46.690" end="01:46.900">i</span><span begin="01:47.000" end="01:47.120">f</span> <span begin="01:47.120" end="01:47.510">we</span> <span begin="01:47.510" end="01:48.310">ri</span><span begin="01:48.310" end="01:48.560">se</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但请记住 只要我们挺身而起</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">但請記住 只要我們挺身而起</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">だが忘れるな 俺たちが立ち上がり</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하지만 기억해 우리가 일어선다면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mais rappelle-toi que si nous nous relevons</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pero recuerda que si nos alzamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Doch denk immer daran wenn wir uns erheben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mas lembre-se de que se nos erguermos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Но помни что если мы восстанем</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ma ricorda soltanto che se ci rialziamo</span></p>
      <p begin="01:48.840" end="01:52.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="01:48.840" end="01:48.940">And</span> <span begin="01:49.060" end="01:49.350">ju</span><span begin="01:49.350" end="01:49.500">s</span><span begin="01:49.500" end="01:49.590">t</span> <span begin="01:49.590" end="01:49.820">o</span><span begin="01:49.970" end="01:50.230">pe</span><span begin="01:50.230" end="01:50.480">n u</span><span begin="01:50.650" end="01:51.080">p ou</span><span begin="01:51.080" end="01:52.110">r eye</span><span begin="01:52.110" end="01:52.350">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">睁开双眼 看清眼前的一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">睜開雙眼 看清眼前的一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">その目を見開きさえすれば</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그리고 두 눈을 활짝 뜬다면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et ouvrons simplement les yeux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y simplemente abrimos los ojos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und einfach unsere Augen öffnen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E simplesmente abrirmos os olhos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И просто откроем глаза</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E apriamo finalmente gli occhi</span></p>
      <p begin="01:53.520" end="01:55.540" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="01:53.520" end="01:53.640">The</span> <span begin="01:53.770" end="01:54.100">pain</span> <span begin="01:54.190" end="01:54.490">can't</span> <span begin="01:54.490" end="01:54.680">s</span><span begin="01:54.680" end="01:54.950">to</span><span begin="01:55.100" end="01:55.420">p u</span><span begin="01:55.420" end="01:55.540">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">苦痛便无法阻挡我们</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">苦痛便無法阻擋我們</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">どんな痛みも俺たちを止められない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">고통도 우릴 막지 못해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La douleur ne peut nous arrêter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El dolor no puede detenernos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Kann der Schmerz uns nicht aufhalten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A dor não pode nos deter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Боль не сможет нас остановить</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il dolore non può fermarci</span></p>
