      <p begin="03:01.470" end="03:06.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49"><span begin="03:01.470" end="03:01.570">C</span><span begin="03:01.570" end="03:01.850">ra</span><span begin="03:01.850" end="03:02.030">sh</span> <span begin="03:02.030" end="03:02.220">it</span> <span begin="03:02.420" end="03:02.740">down</span> <span begin="03:02.860" end="03:03.010">ju</span><span begin="03:03.010" end="03:03.120">st</span> <span begin="03:03.120" end="03:03.200">to</span> <span begin="03:03.310" end="03:03.590">bring</span> <span begin="03:03.590" end="03:03.800">it</span> <span begin="03:04.000" end="03:04.440">back</span> <span begin="03:04.640" end="03:04.890">to</span> <span begin="03:04.890" end="03:06.070">li</span><span begin="03:06.070" end="03:06.280">fe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲手将它击碎 只为令其重获新生</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">親手將它擊碎 只為令其重獲新生</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">すべてを叩き壊し 再び命を吹き込むんだ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">다시 되살리기 위해 모조리 무너뜨릴 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tout faire s'effondrer pour lui redonner vie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Lo derribaré solo para devolverle la vida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Alles niederreißen nur um es wieder zum Leben zu erwecken</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Derrubar tudo só para trazê-lo de volta à vida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Разрушу всё лишь затем чтобы вернуть к жизни</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Abbatterò tutto solo per riportarlo in vita</span></p>
